{"word":"ἱστός","uri":"histos","senses":[{"word":"ἱστός","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἱστός,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">οῦ</span>\n<span class=\"art\">(<span class=\"grec\">ὁ</span>)</span> <span class=\"ital\">propr.</span> objet dressé, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> mât de navire,\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 434,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 424,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> rouleau vertical\n<span class=\"ital\">chez les anciens, non horizontal comme chez\nnous</span> (<span class=\"ital\">sauf aux Gobelins et dans les\nmanufactures de l’Inde</span>), <span class=\"ital\">d’où partent les\nfils de la chaîne sur un métier de tisserand, d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> métier de tisserand,\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 491 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 357,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἱστὸν\nστήσασθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">777,</span> dresser le métier,\n<span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span> commencer une trame ;\n<span class=\"grec\">ἱστὸν ἐποίχεσθαι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 31 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 62,</span> aller et venir\nsur le métier, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. du tisserand</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\nsuite,</span> la chaîne fixée sur le métier, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> la trame : <span class=\"grec\">ἱστὸν\nὑφαίνειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 125 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 104,</span>